The trapezoidal approximation to the integral is
\[
2\frac{0+4}{2}
+3\frac{4+13}{2}
+2\frac{13+21}{2}
+1\frac{21+23}{2}
=85.5.
\]
Therefore
\[
\boxed{\frac{85.5}{8}=10.6875\ \text{hundreds of entries}}.
\]
This is the average number of entries in the box during the eight-hour period, approximately \(1069\) entries.
